;; Ported from OCaml 5.5.0 (the release tarball, SHA-256 fcc6ae665d1ec51d52510eaac7834a86a9806bf5a258bb7cca78733fccf015ba):
;; the pretty-printing engine of stdlib/format.ml (the queue, the scan stack, format_pp_token, advance_left, set_size,
;; the boxes and break hints; no tabulations, tags or ellipsis), whose notice follows (LICENSE.md, "The OCaml Core
;; System"):
;;
;;                                 OCaml
;;
;;             Pierre Weis, projet Cristal, INRIA Rocquencourt
;;
;;   Copyright 1996 Institut National de Recherche en Informatique et
;;     en Automatique.
